OL,3,GNEWSAMothballed Scottish spaceport     
OL,4,Ahelps inspire new BBC sci-fi thriller  
OL,6,FA project to establish a spaceport in  
OL,7,Fthe Scottish Highlands has played a    
OL,8,Fpart in inspiring a new BBC sci-fi     
OL,9,Fthriller.                              
OL,11,FPlans to launch small satellites from a
OL,12,Ffacility near Tongue, in Sutherland,   
OL,13,Fwere unveiled in 2018, but the site    
OL,14,Fremains largely undeveloped after the  
OL,15,Foperator Orbex put construction on hold
OL,16,Fbefore it later collapsed.             
OL,18,FThe new series, called Sutherland,     
OL,19,Fstars Gugu Mbatha-Raw and Stuart Martin
OL,20,Fand is set in the near future in the   
OL,21,Farea of the north Highlands it is named
OL,22,Fafter - as well as deep space.         
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
